# `view_errors.list`

List recorded view runtime errors.

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.views.read`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `since` | `number` |
| `view` | `string` |
| `limit` | `number` |

## Returns

`ListViewErrorsResponse` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `errors` | `map` |
| `total` | `number` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call view_errors.list --json '{ "since": 0, "view": "", "limit": 0 }'
```

Kind: read.

## Example response

```json
{
  "errors": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "view": "specs-detail",
      "url": "/views/specs/checkout-flow",
      "kind": "js-error",
      "message": "Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'acceptance')",
      "stack": "TypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined\n    at SpecDetail.render (spec-detail.js:42)",
      "filename": "spec-detail.js",
      "line": 42,
      "column": 18,
      "timestamp_server_ms": 1748822400000
    }
  ],
  "total": 1
}
```
